{"id":"545853811ce0a4b6","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-generic.md","title":"Generic Filter","display":"df-generic — Generic Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generic","aliases":["58-df-generic"],"display":"df-generic — Generic Filter","depends_on":["[[58-df-transitive-set]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic — Generic Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in V\">\\(M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G \\subseteq P\">\\(G \\subseteq P\\)</span> (filter candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\">\\(\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2\\)</span> (forcing order)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\)</span> (transitive-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"58-df-transitive-set\">58-df-transitive-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (filter predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\)</span> (fully parameterized generic predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\)</span> (compatibility predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A generic filter over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> meets every dense subset of the ordered forcing notion that belongs to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This property ensures the filter is &quot;generic&quot; with respect to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span></li>\n<li>Generic filters are used to construct forcing extensions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-transitive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-transitive-set","status":"resolved","id":"c14ba496c480dcd6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)$ (transitive-set predicate, see [[58-df-transitive-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)$ (poset predicate, see [[58-df-poset]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G \\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_P\\subseteq P^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(M)\\land P,\\leq_P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,\\leq_P)\\land\\forall D\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\\bigl(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\bigr)\\to G\\cap D\\neq\\emptyset\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}compatibility} \\vdash \\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\leq_P\\in M\\;\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,\\leq_P,M)","display":true},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false}],"bytes":1472,"backlinks":[{"id":"e71245fcb536dc32","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1e3f4af7bf60a629","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (model-relative generic-filter predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])"},{"id":"03c99436575af9c5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8eb8466c3c417107","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"196cc15aecc1c1ef","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"15bc9a2ed3c9c46d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a2335a033d2b39a0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"360cd416ab61de6f","anchor":"ref-5","loca